# the validation/logs/ file that produced them").
#
# ENV (as reported in-session): torch + CUDA (Colab GPU), bf16 autocast, MinGRU
# per-layer gradient checkpointing, Adam, grad-clip 1.0, warmup 2000 -> cosine.
# CONFIG: D=2048 L=32 (2B trunk) | hybrid vocab (128k BBPE, opcode-atomic) |
#         FrozenSlotRouter context source | hardened theta=f(c) memory |
#         B=8 S=768 | CB_BIND_W=0.42 CB_BIND_N=16 (MAP scheme, torch_ops.py)
# BASELINE: an A/B baseline checkpoint (no binding loss) was saved as ckpt_1;
#           its bpc-at-matched-step was NOT captured numerically (open item).
